<title>FINLAND: TABLE-MERITA JAN-JUNE PROFIT ALMOST TRIPLES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-MERITA JAN-JUNE PROFIT ALMOST TRIPLES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses    1,813  vs 681</p>
<p> Net loan and guarantee losses		 325  vs 824</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations    2,092  vs 1,995</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  1.99  vs 0.77</p>
<p> Capital adequacy (BIS), percent	    11.6  vs 10.9</p>
<p> Merita Bank income to expenses ratio     1.73  vs 1.40</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish banking group Merita Oy's H1 operating profit after credit losses had been 1,496 million markka (range 1,315-1,800).</p>
</text>
